  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global Opportunities for the Long-Term Development of the Artisanal and Small-Scale Gold Mining Sector in Senegal &#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x201c; planetGOLD Senegal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project design has considered socio-economic benefits to be delivered by the project and these have been clearly described in the Project Description and will be monitored and reported on during project implementation. The project will deliver key socio-economic benefits by Improving health and safety through reduced mercury use and safer mining practices, Increasing incomes through formalization, access to better technologies, and fairer gold prices, Empowering women by promoting their inclusion in the mining sector and access to opportunities, Protecting the environment through cleaner mining methods and land restoration, Strengthening governance by formalizing ASGM and enhancing institutional capacity, Enhancing financial inclusion through access to financial services.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To protect human health and the environment from the toxic use of mercury in Senegal&#xe2;&#x20ac;&#x2122;s ASGM sector</narrative>
  </description>
